-that is neither hybrid SSM nor hybrid SWA (no preemption in any case)."""
+"""Gating of the per-round batch_is_full reset in _get_new_batch_prefill_raw.
+
+The reset is unconditional (re-based #35609): a finished chunked-prefill
+continuation can free the final allocatable slot without shrinking the
+running batch, so every configuration re-runs admission each round. The
+allocatable-request gate re-latches when the pool is genuinely full, so this
+test suite verifies the latch is cleared in all four configurations."""
 
